metadata/design_notes = "Treasure rooms: percentages of common, uncommon, rare, prototype, corrupted. The vault is the reward for exploring a dead end, so it leans rarer than a combat clear: rare 28% against 9%. Corrupted is 15% here too; see clear_drop_table.tres for why."
